{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot asteroids, dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and fight giant, screen-filling bosses with unique mechanics to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins, engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and play the local Asymmetrical Co-op mode, player 2 supports from above using long range attacks and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take a break from the fast paced arcade gameplay? Then try the ore mining extraction mode and still earn EXP and cosmetics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade CRT screen feel but with modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Customise your ship</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run you can choose from your unlocked ship skins and engine trails. Also select which special power to play with from 5 each with unique effects, power up your special meter by destroying asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 Ship skins and 27 Engine trails to unlock as well as permanent stat boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ae85b9e872436923742e4609845bf306.avif?t=1769461925\" width=736 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/4c97642658a9e6660d07288cfbdf4136.avif?t=1769461925\" width=736 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>15 Arcade mode Levels</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and random environmental hazards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Asymmetrical co-op mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the arcade mode with a local friend who plays as a support operator, helping from above to destroy asteroids as well as placing traps, spawning power-ups and drones. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=608 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 12 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shots to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Salvage mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Minute extraction style missions to mine ore from asteroids and transport it to the portal. If you survive your ore is turned into player EXP to level up and unlock cosmetic rewards such as ship skins and engine trails! Choose from 4 missions each with different levels of difficulty and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent! This can also be played on one steam deck, each player holding one side of the deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1769461925","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4082580?t=1769461925","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/37a83a75cb75b8e6c11f71a0b3504e997c352bc2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769461925","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/37a83a75cb75b8e6c11f71a0b3504e997c352bc2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769461925","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot asteroids, dodge gravity wells and black holes whilst grabbing power-ups and fight giant, screen-filling bosses with unique mechanics to master. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll die. A lot. But you'll also unlock permanent upgrades, ship skins, engine trail cosmetics and become stronger with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring a friend and play the local Asymmetrical Co-op mode, player 2 supports from above using long range attacks and traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to take a break from the fast paced arcade gameplay? Then try the ore mining extraction mode and still earn EXP and cosmetics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Retro Vector Graphics</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All visuals are drawn in real-time, authentically recreating the classic arcade CRT screen feel but with modern visual effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/f5b4fb41abc7996d8d7c7d21c440d466.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Customise your ship</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each run you can choose from your unlocked ship skins and engine trails. Also select which special power to play with from 5 each with unique effects, power up your special meter by destroying asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 20 Ship skins and 27 Engine trails to unlock as well as permanent stat boosts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ae85b9e872436923742e4609845bf306.avif?t=1769461925\" width=736 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/4c97642658a9e6660d07288cfbdf4136.avif?t=1769461925\" width=736 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>15 Arcade mode Levels</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against 5 unique asteroid types (Armoured, Elite, Phased, Tethered &amp; more!), alien ships, and random environmental hazards.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/b596cc77773e272503c20ebb6ff34b08.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Asymmetrical co-op mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the arcade mode with a local friend who plays as a support operator, helping from above to destroy asteroids as well as placing traps, spawning power-ups and drones. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=608 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/7adbe797c1bdf5897589d89433558367.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>5 Boss Battles</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the unique mechanics to defeat 5 bosses, including the Colossus, Crystal Titan, the Alien Dreadship, and the final Super-Asteroid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/0be6ca2f5f428d986dbe27034f525d57.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Power-up Arsenal</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover over 12 unique power-ups that drop from enemies, from bombs and teleportation to spawning clones and detonating rainbow engine trails! Time your charged shots to combo with power-ups for extra effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c90d05bdefa66bbaef2d8571c64412fd.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Salvage mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Minute extraction style missions to mine ore from asteroids and transport it to the portal. If you survive your ore is turned into player EXP to level up and unlock cosmetic rewards such as ship skins and engine trails! Choose from 4 missions each with different levels of difficulty and reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/c5349a4b65a928285bb306ff2f0d3a30.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Gauntlet Mode</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in an endless wave mode where survival unlocks exclusive cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.poster.avif?t=1769461925\" width=600 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.webm?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4082580/extras/ac50f738bde98f00161d0e6ab6d41dda.mp4?t=1769461925\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Local 1v1 Duel</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go head-to-head with a friend in a chaotic duel, spawning asteroids, meteors, and drone ships to crush your opponent! This can also be played on one steam deck, each player holding one side of the deck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["James Suret"],"genres":[{"de